The generator and source text for the MMRF documentation site. No figure on the
site is typed in by hand: sync_facts.py reads the runtime's own artifacts and
refuses to write if any of them fails its own hash check, so a stale number
cannot survive a build.

The site publishes aggregate statistics only. It exposes no input surface, no
target-conditioned query, and no path by which permitted operations compose into
a forbidden one.

